  "description": "Device Detection and User-Agent parser for .NET and C#. Detects the device, browser, operating system, and crawlers from the User-Agent and User-Agent Client Hints, reading a data file on your server. This package is the on-premise Hash engine for the 51Degrees Pipeline API. CMake is used to build the native binaries. An alternative to UAParser.js, DeviceAtlas, and WURFL.",
